{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Lose yourself in the Alphaskuf nightmare</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up after a stormy night to find yourself not in your own bed, but at the heart of a nightmare. Your head is pounding, your memory is blank and one question dominates your thoughts: 'Where am I?'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This place is a maze of dim light, creaking floorboards and whispering shadows. Your only link to reality is a stranger named <strong>Fred</strong>. He has long since come to terms with his situation. He knows the rules. He is ready to reveal the terrifying truth: you are not just lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have become a prisoner in the abode of the <strong>Alphaskuf</strong>. Your new 'paradise' is an endless game of tanks and beer madness. Some people might enjoy this kind of life, but you won't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003220/extras/d530fbf152d67114aeffac5b9148e8e5.avif?t=1768392098\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must walk through the <strong>Alphaskuf's</strong> house, constantly encountering obstacles. This game combines the tense atmosphere of classic horror games with extraordinary humour. One moment you will be trembling with fear; the next, you will be laughing so hard that you forget all about the tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual atmosphere: horror and absurd humour</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological pressure and a sense of hopelessness.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A memorable and ambiguous guide character.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satirical undertones.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003220/extras/93f71e29460c32b4f121d0b3a97ba4ec.avif?t=1768392098\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Where am I?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003220/1d6eeaed3cab13a42197d30187dac547faef29d7.jpg"},{"name":"Hope","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003220/60150cc88b7bcab9108e07a7ae211ed655add728.jpg"},{"name":"The first meeting","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003220/582c683c31eb13ab5eae16ab5bc623265636c68d.jpg"},{"name":"Interesting choice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003220/b07a3b22b660c8ea1e71222a6f07531eb1515389.jpg"},{"name":"Sad choice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003220/1b908ed454bc4d2360bf574579d403c4d315fcd5.jpg"},{"name":"In the villain's lair","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003220/183ab33a681bf669ae9badbf46e0b9cc1699b2d9.jpg"},{"name":"Freedom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003220/9aba72ffdefbccb0635b634625088a22b02a4fc5.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4003220?t=1768392098","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4003220?t=1768392098","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003220/65ee10857a19ed61702d1d2ec664fcf1e1bb4c03/capsule_23